<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM Q3 operating data.</title>
<headline>KLM Q3 operating data.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q3 1996/97 to Dec 31 1996.</p>
<p>PASSENGER TRAFFIC</p>
<p>    Load factor (pct)		     73.5     vs   71.2</p>
<p>    Yield per RPK (guilders)	    0.134   vs    0.137</p>
<p>CARGO TRAFFIC</p>
<p>    Load factor (pct)		     68.2     vs   68.0</p>
<p>    Yield per RTK (guilders)	     0.455   vs    0.442</p>
<p>TOTAL TRAFFIC</p>
<p>    Load factor (pct)		     73.2     vs   72.1</p>
<p>    Break-even load factor (pct)	73.4     vs   70.0</p>
<p>    Yield per RTK (guilders)	     0.965   vs    0.949</p>
<p>NOTES - RPK = revenue-passenger kilometres.</p>
<p>		RTK = revenue-tonne kilometres</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
